Ignore IL and DL outside the scroll region like xterm; in a synchronized
update the client kept the old lines.
https://github.com/tmux/tmux/issues/5754
https://github.com/tmux/tmux/commit/5965228c1f20a835ca9bd3bdf5152b40e531d81c

diff --git a/screen-write.c b/screen-write.c
index d7bc6b2a..d8a8a56d 100644
